<section class="page-hero container"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CURIOSITY GOES A LONG WAY</span><h1>Built for the<br><span class="purple-text">joy of knowing.</span></h1><p>BrainLoop is a digital flashcard learning application designed to make active recall and spaced repetition simple, organized, and effective.</p></section>
